.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rayscan-distributed-agent 1  "agent " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-distributed\-agent \- Listen for jobs pushed by a coordinator (inbound mode)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBagent\fR [\fB\-\-listen\fR] [\fB\-\-token\fR] [\fB\-\-concurrency\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Listen for jobs pushed by a coordinator (inbound mode)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-listen\fR \fI<ADDR>\fR [default: 127.0.0.1:9091]
Agent listen address
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<TOKEN>\fR
Bearer token (or RAYSCAN_DISTRIBUTED_TOKEN), at least 16 characters
.TP
\fB\-\-concurrency\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 1]
Maximum scans executed concurrently on this agent
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
